WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:04.650
If you ever take a trip across the pond, to
some of the more rural parts of the British

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:10.420
Isles, you might just hear some tales of a
dark, shadowy shape, a creature stalking through

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:13.250
the night, an omen of death.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:19.720
It’s an entity that has been known by many
names, including The Grim, or Black Shuck.

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:24.461
Most folks will tell you the same, that this
nightmare takes on the form of a huge, black

00:00:24.461 --> 00:00:28.660
dog, but is also known to be able to change
its shape.

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:33.280
Often appearing at night time, the apparition
is said to be demonic in nature, commonly

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:38.679
associated with the Devil himself, believed
by some to be a hell hound like Garmr and

00:00:38.679 --> 00:00:43.420
Cerberus, guardians of the Underworld in Norse
and Greek mythology.

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:48.350
The dog is far larger than your average pet,
with big, glowing eyes.

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:54.510
It is also known to stalk crossroads, ancient
pathways, and places where executions took

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:55.510
place.

00:00:55.510 --> 00:01:00.320
Those who catch sight of Black Shuck are often
befallen with bad luck, and for some it can

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:03.710
even mean that death will soon be upon them.

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:08.290
Of course, this is nothing more than a bit
of local folklore, spooky tales designed to

00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:09.530
drum up tourism.

00:01:09.530 --> 00:01:15.840
But, is the Black Shuck really just a legend
or is there something more to the tale?

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:20.980
After all, it’s not as if a dog like that
could really exist, could it?

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:27.770
Enter SCP-023, otherwise known as – yes,
you guessed it - the Black Shuck.

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:34.000
Much like the creature from the stories, SCP-023
is an entity possessing a canine form, far

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:36.600
larger than most domesticated dogs.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:41.850
SCP-023 is described as being “shaggy”
in appearance, with black fur and glowing

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:45.960
orange-red eyes, as well as prominent fangs.

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:51.480
Through testing, the SCP Foundation has determined
a number of the dog’s anomalous abilities.

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:56.350
First and foremost, legends have described
the Black Shuck as an apparition or a spirit,

00:01:56.350 --> 00:02:02.020
and much in the same vein, SCP-023 is able
to phase right through solid matter.

00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:07.230
The creature can pass through walls seemingly
at will, but does also seem to have a physical

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:10.380
form, at least when it is kept in containment.

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:15.470
To prevent a breach, the Foundation keeps
SCP-023 in a walled off intersection of two

00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:22.210
corridors, sporting fake doors at three of
its four ends, with only one real entrance.

00:02:22.210 --> 00:02:25.820
Why does the dog’s containment unit require
such a specific layout?

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:32.210
Simple, it has to resemble a crossroad, even
if this is merely a superficial resemblance.

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:36.640
Remember that the Black Shuck of legend often
appeared at crossroads, a sign that would

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:39.750
warn those traveling of their impending doom.

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:45.910
As long as SCP-023 remains contained in a
cell resembling crossroads, it cannot pass

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:47.400
through walls.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:52.370
Should the Black Shuck ever escape this enclosure,
however, then it will use its anomalous abilities

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:55.010
to incinerate anything in its path.

00:02:55.010 --> 00:02:59.700
The dog can burn through walls, no matter
how dense, and will travel from location to

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.200
location by this method.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:07.260
Also in keeping with the Shuck of folklore,
looking into the eyes of SCP-023 can hold

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:09.780
potentially devastating outcomes.

00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:15.140
Should any person make direct eye contact
with the dog, then death will be upon them.

00:03:15.140 --> 00:03:19.490
Within the span of the next full year, either
the person who looked the Black Shuck in the

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:25.420
eye or a close member of their family, will
die, just like a number of the legends state.

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:30.330
The Foundation has no concrete idea how the
Shuck chooses its victims, with no patterns

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:36.010
or obvious preferences, only that they will
die a year after eye contact.

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:40.730
Researchers aren’t even sure if SCP-023
selects its victim from the moment eye contact

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:45.820
is made, or if this choice is made during
the year that follows, or if it even is a

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:47.610
conscious choice at all.

00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:52.280
All that is known for certain is that if you
were to look into the beast’s glowing eyes,

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:57.290
there would be no way for you to tell if you
or a relative would suffer the consequences,

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:59.080
only when.

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:03.980
In the past, the SCP Foundation attempted
to eliminate an individual that looked into

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:10.569
SCP-023’s eyes, along with their whole family
before the year was up, trying to take any

00:04:10.569 --> 00:04:15.940
potential victims away from the Black Shuck
before they could be hunted down by the anomalous

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:16.989
canine.

00:04:16.989 --> 00:04:21.519
Much like the way the creature passes through
walls by incinerating solid matter, the way

00:04:21.519 --> 00:04:27.809
SCP-023 dispatches its chosen victims seems
to also be linked to the use of heat.

00:04:27.809 --> 00:04:33.680
The Foundation has conducted a number of autopsies
on those killed by SCP-023, and their findings

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:36.680
have always yielded the same result.

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:41.599
Anyone killed by the Black Shuck will not
exhibit any signs of external damage, no burn

00:04:41.599 --> 00:04:44.449
marks on their skin or any kind of contusions.

00:04:44.449 --> 00:04:49.669
However, on closer inspection, these bodies
appear to have been “filled in”, their

00:04:49.669 --> 00:04:53.440
insides replaced with highly compacted ash.

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:58.289
All their organs and internal bodily systems
appear to be incinerated by the Black Shuck,

00:04:58.289 --> 00:05:03.520
but somehow this occurs so rapidly that there
is no notable damage caused to the outside

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:04.819
of their bodies.

00:05:04.819 --> 00:05:11.400
To prevent SCP-023 claiming any further victims,
the Foundation has another measure in place.

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:15.419
The Black Shuck has been fitted with two spheres
made of hard rubber.

00:05:15.419 --> 00:05:20.580
These are inserted into the creature’s sunken
eye sockets, blocking anyone from accidentally

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:22.699
making eye contact with it.

00:05:22.699 --> 00:05:27.409
However, over time, thanks to the heating
effect of the Shuck’s stare, these inserts

00:05:27.409 --> 00:05:29.449
will begin to degrade.

00:05:29.449 --> 00:05:34.569
When security cameras detect that the glow
of SCP-023’s eyes has returned to a dangerous

00:05:34.569 --> 00:05:39.589
level, Foundation personnel will have to replace
the rubber spheres to once again block the

00:05:39.589 --> 00:05:40.589
creature’s vision.

00:05:40.589 --> 00:05:45.520
However, this can only be done after sunset,
and any personnel tasked with replacing the

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:50.949
inserts are cautioned not to look the dog
in the eyes during this process, unless they

00:05:50.949 --> 00:05:54.229
want to become the Black Shuck’s next victim.

00:05:54.229 --> 00:05:59.629
The SCP Foundation first came into contact
with SCP-023 when they received information

00:05:59.629 --> 00:06:01.560
about an attack that had taken place at a
church.

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:07.650
While the location of this incident is unknown,
if the legends are to be believed, the church

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:11.460
may have been located in the moors of a rural
region of the British Isles.

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:15.960
While the church was in the middle of a service,
the Black Shuck entered and killed a number

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:18.110
of civilians in attendance.

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:23.030
Presumably, the members of this congregation
had all, at some point, seen the large, black

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:26.699
dog out in the moors, or one of their relatives
had.

00:06:26.699 --> 00:06:31.710
The Foundation stepped in and managed to capture
the Black Shuck, giving amnestics to the survivors

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:33.610
that had witnessed the attack.

00:06:33.610 --> 00:06:39.289
The damage done by SCP-023 and the deaths
it caused were covered up as attempted arson.

00:06:39.289 --> 00:06:44.240
However, the Foundation’s trouble with SCP-023
was far from over.

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:48.279
After the Black Shuck’s capture at the church,
the dog was able to breach containment on

00:06:48.279 --> 00:06:49.369
multiple occasions.

00:06:49.369 --> 00:06:54.289
At first, it had been placed in a standard
containment chamber, but it was quickly able

00:06:54.289 --> 00:06:57.300
to incinerate through the concrete walls of
the cell.

00:06:57.300 --> 00:07:01.639
Foundation personnel later discovered the
dog had settled in an intersection between

00:07:01.639 --> 00:07:06.289
two corridors, and realized that it resembled
a crossroad.

00:07:06.289 --> 00:07:11.960
These exact corridors became the basis for
SCP-023’s new containment chamber, and the

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:17.360
assistant researcher originally assigned to
the dog was reprimanded for negligence.

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:22.919
During this, and other escape attempts, SCP-023
caused the deaths of a high number of Foundation

00:07:22.919 --> 00:07:24.009
personnel.

00:07:24.009 --> 00:07:29.139
As a direct result, researchers assigned to
it requested that the Black Shuck be reclassified

00:07:29.139 --> 00:07:31.250
as a Keter class anomaly.

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:38.430
They also noted that SCP-023 shared certain
traits with SCP-1111-1, one of the two entities

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:41.059
that form SCP-1111.

00:07:41.059 --> 00:07:47.439
SCP-1111-1, also referred to as The White
Dog, possesses an almost ghostly, translucent

00:07:47.439 --> 00:07:51.639
canine form and abilities that focus on geographic
space.

00:07:51.639 --> 00:07:57.780
In the White Dog’s case, it will attack
anyone it detects approaching SCP-1111-2,

00:07:57.780 --> 00:08:02.210
the body of an unidentified man hanging from
a noose.

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:08.929
Researchers working for the Foundation believed
that SCP-023 and SCP-1111-1 might be instances

00:08:08.929 --> 00:08:14.119
of the same phenomenon, but have been unable
to capture the White Dog in order to verify

00:08:14.119 --> 00:08:15.119
this.

00:08:15.119 --> 00:08:19.129
Given the number of deaths the Black Shuck
had caused, research personnel attempted to

00:08:19.129 --> 00:08:22.729
reduce the danger that they faced when interacting
with the dog.

00:08:22.729 --> 00:08:26.860
They hoped to remove the beast’s eyes and
teeth, thus making it safer.

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:32.430
However, it was during an attempt to do so
that SCP-023 once again managed to breach

00:08:32.430 --> 00:08:33.430
containment.

00:08:33.430 --> 00:08:39.120
At first, everything seemed to be going according
to plan, but when researchers removed SCP-023’s

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:43.719
eyes, the Black Shuck vanished completely
from its containment area.

00:08:43.719 --> 00:08:48.920
SCP security staff scoured the area for it,
eventually tracking the dog down to a long

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:50.220
stretch of interstate.

00:08:50.220 --> 00:08:55.279
It is still unknown exactly how many civilians
may have seen the Black Shuck as they drove

00:08:55.279 --> 00:09:00.740
past it, but so far nine deaths are thought
to have stemmed from this incident.

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:05.680
The ghostly dog was recaptured, and D-Class
personnel removed its fangs.

00:09:05.680 --> 00:09:11.120
After analyzing the times of incidents, researchers
realized that SCP-023 had only been able to

00:09:11.120 --> 00:09:16.430
escape while the sun was up, leading to new
containment procedures mandating that no staff

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:20.149
member was to interact with the Shuck until
after sunset.

00:09:20.149 --> 00:09:26.399
The interstate fiasco led to the doctor assigned
to watch over SCP-023 being suspended, and

00:09:26.399 --> 00:09:30.110
facing a disciplinary review from his Foundation
superiors.

00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:34.430
The blame for the breach in security that
caused the incident was placed at his feet,

00:09:34.430 --> 00:09:38.310
and a new doctor was placed in charge of observing
the Black Shuck.

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:45.740
Unfortunately for this new researcher, the
incidents involving SCP-023 did not stop there.

00:09:45.740 --> 00:09:49.740
The newly appointed doctor attempted to give
the dog a pair of glass eyes to replace the

00:09:49.740 --> 00:09:53.630
ones that had been removed before the previous
containment breach.

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:58.630
Perhaps they thought it was a gesture of kindness,
a compassionate act, or maybe they just thought

00:09:58.630 --> 00:10:01.740
it would look cool for a dog to have glass
eyes.

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:06.310
No matter the reason, it seemed they had forgotten
for a moment that this huge, shadow creature

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:10.019
was an ancient, evil entity and not a dog
at all.

00:10:10.019 --> 00:10:16.100
When the doctor gave the new glass eyes to
SCP-023, they immediately took on the exact

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:18.579
same properties as its old ones.

00:10:18.579 --> 00:10:24.790
They began glowing, molten glass leaking from
the dog’s sockets, and appeared on all reflective

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:28.920
surfaces throughout the site the Shuck was
being held at.

00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:34.670
Everything from mirrors and windows, to lenses
in glasses, computer monitors, anything and

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:36.519
everything glass.

00:10:36.519 --> 00:10:41.000
The Foundation suffered an enormous number
of deaths that day; even staff sitting in

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:45.490
the cafeteria would have seen a version of
those orange glowing eyes staring at them

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:49.920
from the bottom of their bowls, marking them
for a fiery death.

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:55.029
The facility was quickly evacuated, but the
damage had already been done.

00:10:55.029 --> 00:10:59.370
Anyone that had seen a reflection of the Black
Shuck’s eyes would be dead within a year.

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:05.279
Devastated, the new doctor in charge of overseeing
SCP-023 blamed themselves for dooming their

00:11:05.279 --> 00:11:09.570
research team, as well as the rest of the
Foundation staff in the facility.

00:11:09.570 --> 00:11:15.890
When the sun came up over the horizon, a number
of D-Class personnel were sent into SCP-023’s

00:11:15.890 --> 00:11:21.029
enclosure, only to find that the dog had once
again vanished.

00:11:21.029 --> 00:11:26.560
The only trace it had left behind was a puddle
of molten glass burning part of the floor.

00:11:26.560 --> 00:11:31.299
A year later, any and all personnel that had
gazed into the Black Shuck’s eyes were dead,

00:11:31.299 --> 00:11:36.389
and their remains were buried in a mass unmarked
grave near the containment facility.

00:11:36.389 --> 00:11:42.279
Despite the doctor vowing to recapture and
contain SCP-023, it remains unclear if they

00:11:42.279 --> 00:11:44.540
were ever actually successful.

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:49.101
There is a chance that the Black Shuck has
been gradually making its way back home, to

00:11:49.101 --> 00:11:51.579
the moors of the British Isles.

00:11:51.579 --> 00:11:57.389
If so, we’d advise you not to travel after
sundown unless you absolutely have to.

00:11:57.389 --> 00:12:02.230
And if you find yourself at a crossroad, then
pray you don’t catch sight of a hulking,

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:06.540
demonic hound, staring out at you with eyes
that burn through the dark.

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:10.600
If you do, well… we hope you enjoy your
year.

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:17.660
Now go check out “SCP-1913 Deadly Monster
Squad - The Furies” and “SCP-1337 - The

00:12:17.660 --> 00:12:21.699
Hitchhiker” for more freaky creatures from
the SCP Foundation!

